ations, validation rules, and\\nmeasurable outcomes for new data connectors.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",\n      \"dimension\": \"hard\",\n      \"parent_group\": \"requirements\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Define transformations for new data connectors.\",\n      \"quote_or_span\": \"Define API contracts, mappings, transformations, validation rules, and\\nmeasurable outcomes for new data connectors.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",\n      \"dimension\": \"hard\",\n      \"parent_group\": \"requirements\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Define validation rules for new data connectors.\",\n      \"quote_or_span\": \"Define API contracts, mappings, transformations, validation rules, and\\nmeasurable outcomes for new data connectors.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",\n      \"dimension\": \"hard\",\n      \"parent_group\": \"requirements\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Define measurable outcomes for new data connectors.\",\n      \"quote_or_span\": \"Define API contracts, mappings, transformations, validation rules, and\\nmeasurable outcomes for new data connectors.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",\n      \"dimension\": \"hard\",\n      \"parent_group\": \"requirements\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Guide engineering and quality-assurance teams through delivery.\",\n      \"quote_or_span\": \"Guide engineering and quality-assurance teams through delivery while making\\nclear prioritization decisions across competing datasets and stakeholders.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",\n      \"dimension\": \"hard\",\n      \"parent_group\": \"requirements\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Make clear prioritization decisions across competing datasets and stakeholders.\",\n      \"quote_or_span\": \"Guide engineering and quality-assurance teams through delivery while making\\nclear prioritization decisions across competing datasets and stakeholders.\",\n      \"importance\": \"responsibility\",