qp9chTg19sYLF3FZQS7QOpW67bkxh50ncna3Xcg==","summary":[]},{"id":"msg_091ac76bb217f355016aee59cbbb0887d0b5831e49628ab163","type":"message","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"{\n  \"paragraphs\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"As Product Owner at Meridian Drug Knowledge, I managed the clinical and reference-data backlog. I led a terminology classification service through delivery, defining coverage measures and review rules while keeping uncertain cases with scientific reviewers. I gathered requirements from customers and scientists, proposed roadmap priorities, and developed technical specifications from needs that were not yet clearly defined. Earlier at National Formulary Cooperative, my informatics responsibilities included roadmap proposals and managing publishing backlogs for drug-reference databases and APIs.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"b-e02c8105\",\n        \"b-4a42c4b0\",\n        \"b-49f3d437\",\n        \"b-2d93876a\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Alongside product delivery, I built and maintained production pipelines using SQL and Python to map, validate, and load external reference data into PostgreSQL and Neo4j. For customer integrations, I specified REST API payloads and schema mappings, established validation rules, and planned releases that preserved backward compatibility.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"b-87abdca3\",\n        \"b-0e09662d\",\n        \"ctx-cd209614\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Northstar Bioinformatics turns partner-supplied and reference datasets into consistent data products that can be trusted and reused. Its platform connects that work through ingestion, record matching, and traceable data origins for life-sciences use.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"company.posting\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"I designed rules for canonical records and entity resolution across drug, condition, protein, and clinical-trial data, retaining identifiers from the originating sources and their provenance. I also recorded definitions, lineage, and data-quality constraints in a catalog that engineering and customer teams used.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"b-902e8b89\",\n        \"b-dda626ca\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_options":{"mode":"explicit","ttl":"30m"},"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1.0,"text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","description":null,"name":"ConstrainedCoverLetter","schema":{"$defs":{"ConstrainedLetterLine":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"text":{"title":"Text","type":"string"},"source_ids":{"items":{"type":"string"},"title":"Source Ids","type":"array"}},"required":["text","source_ids"],"title":"ConstrainedLetterLine","type":"object"}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"paragraphs":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/ConstrainedLetterLine"},"title":"Paragraphs","type":"array"}},"title":"ConstrainedCoverLetter","type":"object","required":["paragraphs"]},"strict":true},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":5039,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens_details":{"ttl_12h_tokens":0,"ttl_30m_tokens":0},"cached_tokens":1703},"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":425},"total_tokens":5895},"user":null,"metadata":{}},"sequence_number":428}

